Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Quay registry connection failures

Symptom: Unable to pull images from Quay registry
Solution:
# Check registry secret
oc get secret quay-registry-secret -n quay-integration -o yaml

# Verify registry accessibility
curl -k https://quay-registry.apps.cluster.local/v2/
Issue 2: RHACM policies not applying

Symptom: Policies show as non-compliant
Solution:
# Check placement binding
oc get placementbinding -n rhacm-image-management

# Verify managed cluster status
oc get managedclusters
Issue 3: Image pull authentication errors

Symptom: ImagePullBackOff errors in pod events
Solution:
# Recreate image pull secret
oc delete secret quay-registry-secret -n quay-integration
oc create secret docker-registry quay-registry-secret \
  --docker-server=quay-registry.apps.cluster.local \
  --docker-username=admin \
  --docker-password=password123 \
  --docker-email=admin@example.com \
  -n quay-integration
